sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant Gateway as MCP Gateway
    participant API as Hydra API

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Agent,API: Phase 1 — Entrypoint (Awareness)
    Agent->>Gateway: read_api_resource({uri: "/"})
    Gateway->>API: GET /
    API-->>Gateway: Entrypoint + Link: docs.jsonld
    Gateway-->>Agent: Collection links (/books, /reviews, …)
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
    Note over Agent,API: Phase 2 — Collection Visit (Tool Discovery)
    Agent->>Gateway: read_api_resource({uri: "/books"})
    Gateway->>API: GET /books
    API-->>Gateway: hydra:Collection
    Gateway->>API: GET /docs.jsonld
    API-->>Gateway: hydra:ApiDocumentation
    Note over Gateway: Extract operations (names from hydra:title)
    Gateway-->>Agent: notifications/tools/list_changed
    Gateway-->>Agent: Collection JSON-LD
    end

    rect rgb(245, 235, 255)
    Note over Agent,API: Dynamic Tool Execution
    Agent->>Gateway: post_book({title: "1984", author: "Orwell"})
    Gateway->>API: POST /books
    API-->>Gateway: 201 Created
    Gateway-->>Agent: Created resource JSON-LD
    end
